---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<SiteLayout title="Muse — Britt Joosten">
  <main class="muse-page">
    <a class="muse-back" href="/projects/">← Projects &amp; Works</a>

    <article class="muse-content">
      <header class="muse-header">
        <h1>Muse</h1>
      </header>

      <section class="muse-intro" aria-label="Project overview">
        <img
          class="muse-hero-image"
          src="/images/product foto 1.png"
          alt="Muse phone case with its detachable wearable ring"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <dl class="muse-metadata">
          <div>
            <dt>Timeline</dt>
            <dd>Feb. 2025 – Jun. 2025</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Project type</dt>
            <dd>Individual project</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Tools &amp; software</dt>
            <dd>SolidWorks / Adobe Illustrator / Adobe InDesign / Tasker</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Key skills</dt>
            <dd>User Research / Product Development / CAD / Prototyping / Experience Design / Business Modelling</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="muse-story" aria-label="About the project">
        <div class="muse-copy">
          <div>
            <p>
              In a society driven by productivity, taking a break can feel like doing nothing.
              Daydreaming and allowing the mind to wander are often perceived as signs of laziness
              rather than opportunities for creativity and recovery. Meanwhile, constant digital
              stimulation leaves little room for stillness, making intentional rest increasingly
              important.
            </p>
            <p>
              Using a user-centred approach, I analysed mixed-method questionnaire responses to
              identify user needs and translated them into design requirements. Through extensive
              literature research, Quality Function Deployment (QFD), material exploration,
              experience prototyping, and usability testing, I developed and evaluated Muse,
              including its physical-digital interaction.
            </p>
            <p>
              Muse is a phone case and wearable ring designed to create a physical transition from
              digital distraction to mental rest, drawing on the concept of embodied cognition. The
              ring fits into a dedicated slot in the phone case.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p>
              A 90-degree twist releases its metal base while leaving the jewel in place, allowing
              its integrated NFC technology to activate a guided rest programme. This gesture
              represents the mental act of unlocking time to rest. The accompanying digital
              experience offers lessons on the brain, reflection, and daydreaming, helping users
              explore different ways to rest their minds.
            </p>
            <p>
              To explore its commercial viability in the B2C market, I also developed a Business
              Model Canvas and a first-year financial model, considering two product tiers and
              modular accessories.
            </p>
            <p>
              At its core, Muse aims to help people reclaim moments of rest in a world that
              constantly demands their attention. By turning the decision to rest into a tangible
              action, it challenges the idea that every moment needs to be productive and reframes
              rest as an essential part of everyday life.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img
          class="muse-story-image"
          src="/images/product foto 2.png"
          alt="Close view of the Muse ring being attached to the phone case"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </section>
    </article>

    <div class="muse-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="muse-process">
      <section class="muse-process-section concept-section" aria-labelledby="concept-heading">
        <h2 id="concept-heading">Concept exploration</h2>
        <div class="concept-gallery">
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20261119_132059308.jpg"
            alt="Early Muse product and interaction sketches in a notebook"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20261119_132115919.jpg"
            alt="Notebook research and early Muse concept sketches"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20261119_132129449.jpg"
            alt="Early concept development notes and diagrams"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="muse-process-section technical-section" aria-labelledby="technical-heading">
        <h2 id="technical-heading">Technical development</h2>
        <div class="technical-gallery">
          <img
            src="/images/WhatsApp Image 2025-06-01 at 20.37.37 (1).jpeg"
            alt="SolidWorks development render of the Muse phone case"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/WhatsApp Image 2025-06-01 at 21.02.01.jpeg"
            alt="Technical drawing of the phone case and ring mechanism"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/WhatsApp Image 2025-06-01 at 20.37.37.jpeg"
            alt="Final CAD render of the Muse phone case with ring"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="muse-process-section prototype-section" aria-labelledby="prototype-heading">
        <h2 id="prototype-heading">Prototyping &amp; testing</h2>
        <div class="prototype-gallery">
          <img
            class="prototype-development-board"
            src="/images/Asset 1.png"
            alt="Prototype iterations and color options for the Muse ring"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="prototype-photo-grid">
            <img
              src="/images/PXL_20250523_122752418.jpg"
              alt="3D printer producing a Muse prototype"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/PXL_20250514_153340435.jpg"
              alt="Prototype components being printed"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/PXL_20250604_191519412.MP.jpg"
              alt="Printed ring components drying after finishing"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/PXL_20250514_084308655.jpg"
              alt="Finished Muse ring and connector prototypes"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
  html:has(.muse-page),
  body:has(.muse-page) {
    height: auto;
    min-height: 100%;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .muse-page {
    --muse-pink: #ffc9cc;
    --muse-ink: #172332;
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: 1px 0 4rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--muse-ink);
    font-family: 'Avenir', Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .muse-back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: 2rem;
    z-index: 2;
    color: var(--muse-ink);
    font-family: 'Vipnagorgialla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .muse-back:hover,
  .muse-back:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  .muse-content,
  .muse-process {
    width: min(64%, 980px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .muse-content {
    padding-top: clamp(6.5rem, 12vh, 9.5rem);
  }

  .muse-header h1,
  .muse-process-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muse-pink);
    font-family: 'Vipnagorgialla', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .muse-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.75vw, 2.85rem);
  }

  .muse-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(16rem, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);
  }

  .muse-hero-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .muse-metadata {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(0.85rem, 1.3vw, 1.25rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .muse-metadata dt {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.78vw, 0.85rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .muse-metadata dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 0.8vw, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .muse-story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(14rem, 0.85fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 4rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 4rem);
  }

  .muse-copy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 1.8vw, 1.75rem);
    font-size: clamp(0.76rem, 0.8vw, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .muse-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .muse-story-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .muse-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(0.65rem, 0.9vw, 0.95rem);
    background: var(--muse-pink);
  }

  .muse-process {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .muse-process-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .muse-process-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .muse-process-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.1vw, 2.2rem);
  }

  .concept-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 0.78fr 1.42fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .concept-gallery img,
  .technical-gallery img,
  .prototype-gallery img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .concept-gallery img {
    aspect-ratio: 0.72;
  }

  .concept-gallery img:last-child {
    aspect-ratio: 1.55;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .technical-section h2 {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .technical-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.86fr 1.2fr 0.86fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .technical-gallery img {
    aspect-ratio: 1.08;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #f7f7f7;
  }

  .technical-gallery img:nth-child(2) {
    aspect-ratio: 1.65;
  }

  .prototype-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .prototype-development-board {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .prototype-photo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .prototype-photo-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.85;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .muse-content,
    .muse-process {
      width: min(86%, 760px);
    }

    .muse-content {
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }

    .muse-intro {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .muse-story {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, 0.75fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .muse-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .concept-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .concept-gallery img:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      aspect-ratio: 1.8;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .muse-page {
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .muse-back {
      top: 1.25rem;
      left: 1.15rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .muse-content,
    .muse-process {
      width: calc(100% - 2.25rem);
    }

    .muse-content {
      padding-top: 4.5rem;
    }

    .muse-header h1 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 11vw, 3.7rem);
    }

    .muse-intro,
    .muse-story,
    .prototype-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .muse-intro {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .muse-metadata {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .muse-metadata dt {
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .muse-metadata dd {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .muse-story {
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .muse-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .muse-story-image {
      width: min(100%, 28rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .muse-process {
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .muse-process-section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .muse-process-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 2.2rem);
    }

    .concept-gallery,
    .technical-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .concept-gallery img:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 0.72;
    }

    .technical-section h2 {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .technical-gallery img:nth-child(2) {
      aspect-ratio: 1.08;
    }

    .technical-gallery img:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      aspect-ratio: 1.5;
    }

    .prototype-development-board {
      aspect-ratio: 0.95;
    }

    .prototype-photo-grid img {
      aspect-ratio: 0.88;
    }
  }
</style>